        "source": "/* Platform headers for the server libraries: POSIX sockets, polling and errors. */\n#include <sys/types.h>\n#include <sys/socket.h>\n#include <netinet/in.h>\n#include <poll.h>\n#include <errno.h>",
        "sourceLanguageId": "",
        "initialization": "",
        "initializationLanguageId": "",
        "specification": "Platform library: the POSIX socket, polling and errno headers shared by the server code,\nlent to socket_accept as `platform` and to lib_http_server. It declares no functions.",
